@startuml
title ACT-06 - Extract Markdown Source from a PDF

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1
skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor white
    BorderColor black
    FontColor black
    DiamondBackgroundColor white
    DiamondBorderColor black
}
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black

|Author / AI Assistant / External Tool|
start
:Provide PDF file;

|Source Extraction Service|
:Inspect PDF format;
if (PDF supported?) then (yes)
    :Read PDF metadata;
    if (Litho metadata present and readable?) then (yes)
        :Extract embedded Markdown source;
        :Extract template identifier and version;
        :Restore Markdown source and provenance;
        :Package extracted files;
    else (no)
        :Report missing or corrupted Litho metadata;
    endif
else (no)
    :Report unsupported PDF format;
endif

:Return extraction result and diagnostics;

|Caller|
:Receive extraction response;
stop
@enduml
